  "body_text": null,
  "page": null,
  "source": "[P \\.implies./ Q]\nStates:\nwhen: P, Q is \\\\statement\nthat:\n. if: P\n  then: Q\nDocumented:\n. called: \"$P?$ implies $Q?$\"\n. written: \"P? \\Rightarrow Q?\"\n. description: \"The conditional *if $P$ then $Q$*, written $P \\Rightarrow Q$. It\n                asserts that whenever $P$ holds, $Q$ holds as well. It makes no\n                claim at all in the case that $P$ fails, so a conditional with a\n                false hypothesis is regarded as holding vacuously.\"\nId: \"dc7e213d-76c2-43d7-acf1-c5978daaab33\"",
